<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets warrants on Hoechst AG.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets warrants on Hoechst AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    96.40 DEM		 PREMIUM	26.03 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     14 DEM		    GEARING	6.26 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	23.JUL.99		 PAYDATE	23.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
